      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Monitoring, deploy and maintenance jobs \u2014 latest result",
      "description": "Scheduled checks (drift, cert-expiry, blog site health), manual deploys and the local stack refresh. Monitoring jobs never block a change; a red one alerts (ci_monitoring_failing, ci_site_health_failing). A job that has never run since Jenkins started has no value. Empty is normal right after a restart.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
